From 516126fafe4001d47be6be93b90661370016ad5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Axis <axis@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:17:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Axis 4.3.4: Tools sidebar group, choosable workspace and chat
 folders, terminal command history for agents, pictures in Axis/images

- Sidebar: Images, Art Craft and OCR move into a collapsible Tools group; the Skills page is removed.
- Workspace folder can be any folder on the computer (Axis/workspace-settings.json); default Axis/shared.
- A chat can keep its agent in a folder of its own, saved with the chat.
- Agents cannot leave their folder: Run Python also blocks reads, listings and folder changes outside it;
  terminal and Rust code naming places outside the folder is refused before it runs.
- Agent panels choose how many recent terminal commands (with output) the agent sees.
- Every generated picture is saved in Axis/images instead of the workspace.
- New routes: GET/PUT /api/workspace, GET /api/folders.
